        "effective_step": 7,
        "end_token_index": 815,
        "near_end": false,
        "prefix_token_count": 816,
        "step_number": 7,
        "text": "Step 7: Calculate the magnitude of the cross product.\n\\[\n\\| \\begin{pmatrix} 31 \\\\ -6 \\\\ 58 \\end{pmatrix} \\| = \\sqrt{31^2 + (-6)^2 + 58^2} = \\sqrt{961 + 36 + 3364} = \\sqrt{4361}.\n\\]"
      },
      {
