        "step_number": 8,
        "text": "Step 8: Calculate the magnitude of the direction vector.\n\\[\n\\| \\begin{pmatrix} 2 \\\\ -9 \\\\ -2 \\end{pmatrix} \\| = \\sqrt{2^2 + (-9)^2 + (-2)^2} = \\sqrt{4 + 81 + 4} = \\sqrt{89}.\n\\]"
